co_p:["Thor Ayanundana ผู้พัฒนาแพลตฟอร์มและดูแล<span class='nw'>เครือข่าย</span> <a href='https://thbho.github.io/EngWiderooms.html'>WIDEROOMS</a> × <a class='nw' href='https://thbho.github.io/AIGymmateXFactory.html'>Hybrid AI by ThB.Ho</a>","Thor Ayanundana 打造了这个平台，并负责网络中心。<a href='https://thbho.github.io/EngWiderooms.html'>WIDEROOMS</a> × <a href='https://thbho.github.io/AIGymmateXFactory.html'>Hybrid AI by ThB.Ho</a>，芭提雅。","Thor Ayanundana가 플랫폼을 만들고 네트워크 허브를 운영합니다. <a href='https://thbho.github.io/EngWiderooms.html'>WIDEROOMS</a> × <a href='https://thbho.github.io/AIGymmateXFactory.html'>Hybrid AI by ThB.Ho</a>, 파타야.","Thor Ayanundana がプラットフォームを作り、ネットワークのハブを運営しています。<a href='https://thbho.github.io/EngWiderooms.html'>WIDEROOMS</a> × <a href='https://thbho.github.io/AIGymmateXFactory.html'>Hybrid AI by ThB.Ho</a>、パタヤ。","Thor Ayanundana создал платформу и руководит хабом сети. <a href='https://thbho.github.io/EngWiderooms.html'>WIDEROOMS</a> × <a href='https://thbho.github.io/AIGymmateXFactory.html'>Hybrid AI by ThB.Ho</a>, Паттайя.","Thor Ayanundana creó la plataforma y dirige el hub de la red. <a href='https://thbho.github.io/EngWiderooms.html'>WIDEROOMS</a> × <a href='https://thbho.github.io/AIGymmateXFactory.html'>Hybrid AI by ThB.Ho</a>, Pattaya."],
